  "name": "Dread Presence",
  "type": "effect",
  "img": "icons/magic/control/fear-fright-monster-grin-green.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You are inside an enemy's <strong>Dread Presence</strong> and are <strong>Frightened</strong> at the value on this effect. It cannot be reduced while you remain inside.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Your Will save against the aura's owner (the higher of their Class DC and Spell DC) is rolled automatically when this effect arrives: Frightened 1 on a critical success, 2 on a success, 3 on a failure, 4 on a critical failure (and you drop what you hold and cannot use reactions inside the aura). When it leaves, you keep your Frightened value, and it cannot drop below the result rolled for 1 round (1 minute after a critical failure). Leaving and re-entering rerolls, taking the worse result. Deleting this effect by hand counts as leaving the aura.</p>\n<p>From the owner's 7th level you cannot reduce Frightened below 2 inside the aura, and below 3 from their 13th. From their 15th your attacks against them take a penalty equal to your Frightened value in addition to the usual one. From their 20th you cannot willingly move closer to them while inside.</p>",
      "gm": ""
    },
